<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Private Donor Evening</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
  background: #0b0b0b;
  color: #eaeaea;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}
.container {
  max-width: 420px;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}
h1, h2 {
  font-weight: normal;
}
.section {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.button {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 14px;
  border: 1px solid #888;
  margin-top: 20px;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #eaeaea;
}
.small {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #aaa;
}
input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px;
  margin-top: 10px;
  background: #111;
  border: 1px solid #444;
  color: #fff;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

<div class="section">
  <h2>National Philanthropic Fund</h2>
  <h1>Private Donor Evening</h1>
  <p class="small">By invitation only</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <p>An intimate evening bringing together a select group of individuals across investment, development, and long-term initiatives.</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2>Event</h2>
  <p>Saturday · 8:00 PM<br>Location disclosed upon confirmation<br>Reception · Dinner · Private Auction<br>Black Tie</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2>Guest Reference</h2>
  <p>Referred by:<br><strong>[James Packer</strong></p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2>Participation</h2>
  <p class="small">Attendance is reserved for confirmed contributors.</p>

  <p><strong>Supporting Contributor — USD 5,000</strong></p>
  <p class="small">Entry into the foundation’s work and evening access.</p>

  <p><strong>Principal Contributor — USD 15,000</strong></p>
  <p class="small">Aligned participation within the core guest circle.</p>

  <p><strong>Patron — USD 50,000</strong></p>
  <p class="small">Support toward flagship initiatives.</p>

  <input type="text" placeholder="Enter custom amount (MYR)">

  <a href="#" class="button">Confirm Contribution</a>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <p class="small">Upon confirmation, entry credentials and venue details will be issued.</p>
</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
